SUMMARY:Estonia: Data-based TSD replaces the tax declaration form
DESCRIPTION:Effective 1 Apr 2027. The Tax and Customs Board (MTA) is moving
  to data-based reporting: the accountant will send transaction data to the
  tax authority\, which calculates the taxes itself. MTA confirmed the new 
 system takes effect on 1 April 2027.\n\nSource: https://www.raamatupidaja.
 ee/uudised/2025/01/20/mta-plaanib-raamatupidamiskirjendite-pohise-tsd-kasu
 tuselevottu-2026-aasta-lopus\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/c
 ountries/estonia.html#ee-reporting-upcoming\n\nFor information only\, not 
 legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/estonia.html#ee-reporting-u
 pcoming
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
